        <ExplanationTxt>OUR ORGANIZATION HAS A COMPREHENSIVE WRITTEN CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY THAT WAS ADOPTED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS IN 2021. THROUGHOUT THE YEAR, WE MONITOR POTENTIAL CONFLICTS AND ENSURE THAT THEY ARE DISCLOSED AND MANAGED APPROPIATELY. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS PLAY AN ACTIVE ROLE IN THIS PROCESS, WITH ANY BOARD MEMBER WHO HAS A POTENTIAL CONFLICT RECUSING THEMSELVES FROM RELATED DISCUSSIONS AND VOTES. ALL ACTIONS TAKEN TO ADDRESS CONFLICTS OF INTEREST ARE DOCUMENTED IN OUR MEETING MINUTES AND OTHER ORGANIZATIONAL RECORDS. OUR ORGANIZATION IS COMMITTED TO MAINTAINING TRANSPARENCY AND INTEGRITY IN ALL OUR OPERATIONS, ENSURING THAT ANY CONFLICTS OF INTEREST ARE PROPERLY MANAGED IN ACCORDANCE WITH OUR POLICY.</ExplanationTxt>
